%  Added (SET/GET)HOMMAXDEGREE, and corresponding HMax variants of
% CONSTRUCTNEWCHAINS, et cetera./JoeB 2005-06-25 -- 06-26

%	CHANGES:

%  $Log: chrecord.sl,v $
%  Revision 1.12  1999/11/19 11:38:33  joeb
%  (Minor corrections to the preceeding commitment.)
